Include: include/setup.vader

Given clojure:
  (def world [[1      1 1 1       1]
              [999 999 999 999 1]
              [1 1 1 1 1]
              [1 999 999 999 999]
              [1 1 1 1 1]])

Do (Recursive alignment in blockwise-visual mode):
  f[;
  \<C-V>G
  \<Enter>*\<Space>

Expect clojure:
  (def world [[1   1   1   1   1]
              [999 999 999 999 1]
              [1   1   1   1   1]
              [1   999 999 999 999]
              [1   1   1   1   1]])

Given (help keymap with a ragged description column):
  01 General
  02 ?                    Open or close this keymap
  03 Esc                  Close help/filter, reset sorting, then exit
  04 q / Q                Exit outside the help dialog and filter editing
  05 Ctrl-C               Exit immediately
  06 Navigation
  07 Arrow keys           Move the selected cell
  08 Mouse wheel          Pan without moving the selection
  09 Shift-wheel          Pan horizontally
  10 Sorting
  11 Header click         Sort, promote, or toggle that column
  12 Ctrl-S               Sort the selected cell's column
  13 Ctrl-R               Reset sorting and filters
  14 Filtering
  15 Ctrl-F               Show or hide the filter row
  16 Tab / Shift-Tab      Move between filter fields
  17 Ctrl-A               Move to the beginning of the filter line
  18 Enter                Apply the edit and release filter focus
  19 Filter click         Focus that column's filter field
  20 Column width
  21 Ctrl-Shift-←/→        Shrink or grow the selected column
  22 Mouse drag header          Resize that column

Do (Align the whitespace delimiter crossing the block's left edge):
  2G22|\<C-V>20j7l
  \<Enter>0\<Space>

Expect (help keymap with an aligned description column):
  01 General
  02 ?                    Open or close this keymap
  03 Esc                  Close help/filter, reset sorting, then exit
  04 q / Q                Exit outside the help dialog and filter editing
  05 Ctrl-C               Exit immediately
  06 Navigation
  07 Arrow keys           Move the selected cell
  08 Mouse wheel          Pan without moving the selection
  09 Shift-wheel          Pan horizontally
  10 Sorting
  11 Header click         Sort, promote, or toggle that column
  12 Ctrl-S               Sort the selected cell's column
  13 Ctrl-R               Reset sorting and filters
  14 Filtering
  15 Ctrl-F               Show or hide the filter row
  16 Tab / Shift-Tab      Move between filter fields
  17 Ctrl-A               Move to the beginning of the filter line
  18 Enter                Apply the edit and release filter focus
  19 Filter click         Focus that column's filter field
  20 Column width
  21 Ctrl-Shift-←/→       Shrink or grow the selected column
  22 Mouse drag header    Resize that column

Given (block-edge whitespace with a wider right margin):
  02 ?                    Open or close this keymap
  21 Ctrl-Shift-←/→        Shrink or grow the selected column
  22 Mouse drag header          Resize that column

Do (Align the block edge and set a wider description margin):
  gg22|\<C-V>2j7l
  \<Enter>0\<C-R>10\<CR>\<Space>

Expect (description column shifted by the right margin):
  02 ?                           Open or close this keymap
  21 Ctrl-Shift-←/→              Shrink or grow the selected column
  22 Mouse drag header           Resize that column

Include: include/teardown.vader
